* CLA CLL IAC R3L	; AC0010, 0	/ SET ACCUMULATOR TO 10   (-7770)
* CLA IAC BSW		; AC0100, 0	/ SET ACCUMULATOR TO 100  (-7700)
* CLA CLL CML RTR	; AC2000, 0	/ SET ACCUMULATOR TO 2000 (-6000)
* CLA CLL CMA RAR	; AC3777, 0	/ SET ACCUMULATOR TO 3777 (-4001)
* CLA CLL IAC RTR	; AC4000, 0	/ SET ACCUMULATOR TO 4000 (-4000)
* CLA CLL CMA RTR	; AC5777, 0	/ SET ACCUMULATOR TO 5777 (-2001)
* CLA CLL CML IAC RTR	; AC6000, 0	/ SET ACCUMULATOR TO 6000 (-2000)
