* 4400	  ; EXECUT, 0	/ EXECUTES THE COMPILED FORMULAS
* 4202	  ; BCDCOM, 0	/ ROUTINE TO COMPARE TWO BCD NUMBERS
* 5400	  ; BCDASC, 0	/ ROUTINE TO CONVERT PACKED BCD TO ASCII
			/ USING USER SPECIFIED FORMAT
